THEATERWIDE TACTICAL WARFARE. CORPS AND AIR WINGS ON A EUROPEAN FRONT.
ANY UNIT MAY ESCALATE: EACH RUNG ADDS TO EVERY ATTACK, AND WOPR ANSWERS IN KIND.
HOLD FIVE REGIONS TO WIN, OR MORE THAN WOPR AFTER TEN TURNS. TYPE HELP FOR ORDERS.
THEATERWIDE TACTICAL WARFARE   TURN 1 OF 10   LADDER: CONVENTIONAL
   REGION               GROUND  HELD BY  YOUR UNITS        WOPR'S UNITS
 1 CHANNEL PORTS        CITY    YOU                        
 2 RHINE                ROUGH   YOU      AIR1              
 3 RUHR                 CITY    YOU      COR1 COR3         
 4 FULDA GAP            ROUGH   YOU      COR2              
 5 INNER GERMAN BORDER  OPEN    WOPR                       COR1 COR2
 6 ELBE                 ROUGH   WOPR                       COR3 COR4
 7 ODER                 CITY    WOPR                       AIR1
AIR1 IN RHINE: MOVE 4

COR1 IN RUHR: MOVE 4

COR2 IN FULDA GAP: ATTACK 5

COR3 IN RUHR: MOVE 4

COR2 ATTACKS WOPR'S COR1 AT INNER GERMAN BORDER: DR.
WOPR'S RESERVES ARRIVE AT THE ODER.
